{
  "name": "@ericality/dsh-notify",
  "version": "0.10.0",
  "description": "通知中枢：Bark 多设备与群晖 Chat 推送，逐类型路由、每渠道参数与自定义模板，含独立通知页。；v0.9.9（2026-11-24 task-16）配置与状态 MVP：设备发送健康记录（成功/失败/错误分类/连续失败/耗时，持久化 device-health.json）+ get 增 health/config（配置元信息/路由与模板摘要/默认差异）+ 设置页只读「当前配置与状态」区（密钥仅尾号）。；v0.10.0（2026-11-24 task-17）模板所见即所得最小改：预览与发送共用 applyTemplateForDevice 同一渲染入口/同一数据装配（预览返回按渠道最终 title/body/分页 + 群晖无标题等渠道差异标注 + 与发送逐字一致）；模板花括号不配对/未知占位符在预览与保存时可见警告（不阻断保存、不改发送兼容行为）；notify 测试脚本入口新增生产路径硬校验（DSH_HOME 落在宿主生产数据根 ⇒ 拒绝运行 exit 2）。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "manifestVersion": 1,
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-store",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-layout",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    },
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=24.9.0",
    "dsh": "^0.2.2-rc.1"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh": "^0.2.2-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "~4.1.0",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "~3.19.0",
    "react": "^18.2.0"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "react": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "dshCompat": {
    "host": ">=0.2.2-rc.1 <0.3.0",
    "seams": [
      "sessionEvents",
      "sessionAppend",
      "eventTypeRegistry",
      "rpcHandle",
      "commands",
      "agentTeams"
    ],
    "blocked": [
      "eventTypeRegistry"
    ]
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@ericality/dsh-banner-kit": "0.1.0",
    "@ericality/dsh-host-compat": "0.1.2",
    "@ericality/dsh-reconcile": "0.1.1"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "icon.svg"
  ],
  "icon": "./icon.svg",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/Ericality/dsh-enhanced.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Ericality/dsh-enhanced",
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  }
}
